==============================================================================
Changes made by The See-through Authors
==============================================================================

* The UNet was fine-tuned from Marigold Depth v1.1 for pseudo-depth estimation
  of anime characters, and converted into the multi-frame UNet
  (UNetFrameConditionModel) used by the See-through pipeline.
* All components were saved in the diffusers format.
* The weights were quantised to 4-bit NF4 with bitsandbytes (bfloat16 compute
  dtype), starting from layerdifforg/seethroughv0.0.1_marigold. The UNet and the text
  encoder are quantised; the VAE is unchanged.

